message: "If you use these example queries, please cite them as below."
title: "AOP-Wiki SPARQL examples"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Example SPARQL queries for the AOP-Wiki RDF SPARQL endpoint, each with a permanent
  identifier, a version and metadata, in the format of SIB's sparql-examples.
